# Action sync

Update **all** of these when adding/changing an action ([specs/07-actions.md](specs/07-actions.md)):

1. `DECISION_ACTIONS`, `DECISION_SCHEMA`, `SYSTEM_PROMPT` — `server.py`
2. `apply_decision`, `available_actions` — `sim_engine.py`
3. `ACTION_LABELS` — `index.html` (display only)
4. Spec entry in `07-actions.md` + `normalize_decision` validation if needed
